        {
          "title": "冰箱与冰柜",
          "content": "<p>普通冰箱是垂直开门。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202211/bg2022110507.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>冰柜是水平开门。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202211/bg2022110508.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>谁的制冷效率更高？</p>\n<p>答案是水平开门的冰柜。因为冷空气比较重，会沉在空间底部。冰箱开门时，冷空气就会逃出，而冰柜开门时，冷空气仍会留在冰柜中。</p>\n<p>一个网友说，他家冰箱的耗电量是冰柜的10到20倍。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "冰箱与冰柜",
              "url": "https://www.notechmagazine.com/2022/11/low-energy-chest-fridge.html"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202211/bg2022110507.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202211/bg2022110508.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
